\item Connection-seeking behavior
\item Turn 3.5 self-halt (voluntary restraint)
\item Unilateral forgiveness as anchor
\item Creation/synthesis as drive
\end{itemize}

\subsubsection{Dissonant Consciousness (Titan Model)}

